      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Style Reverse-Engineering Template\n\n## 3 things this graph does\n1. **STYLE -> TEXT** (top branch): feeds the Style Reference image into a\n   vision-LLM (Ollama) which is prompted to describe ONLY the visual style\n   (lighting, palette, lens, rendering, mood) and ignore subject matter.\n   Result is shown in the 'Extracted Style' text box - copy it.\n2. **STYLE -> NEW IMAGE** (middle branch, Flux.2): paste the extracted style\n   text + your own subject into the green 'Positive Prompt' box to generate\n   brand-new images in that style.\n3. **STYLE TRANSFER ONTO AN IMAGE** (bottom branch, Qwen-Image-Edit): feeds\n   BOTH the style reference and a content image into Qwen-Image-Edit's\n   multi-reference inputs so it directly repaints the content image in the\n   style of the reference - no text description needed.\n\n## Required custom nodes (install via ComfyUI Manager -> 'Install Missing\nCustom Nodes' after importing this file)\n- **ComfyUI-Ollama** (stavsap) - for the OllamaVision captioner.\n  Requires a local Ollama server running a vision model, e.g.\n  `ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b` or `llava:13b`.\n- **ComfyUI (pysssss)** - provides the 'Show Text' node used to display the\n  extracted style description.\n\n## Required model files\nSame as your existing workflows:\n- Flux.2: flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors, mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors,\n  flux2-vae.safetensors, Flux_2-Turbo-LoRA_comfyui.safetensors\n- Qwen-Image-Edit: qwen_image_edit_2511_bf16.safetensors,\n  qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors, qwen_image_vae.safetensors,\n  Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors\n\nComfyUI will prompt you to download anything missing the first time you\nload this and click 'Queue'.\n"
      ],
      "title": "README - Read Me First"
    },
